      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also like to have an ability to remove Quest (or PC) versions of avatars, so you don't have to upload a whole new one after your attempt at a quest version goes poorly.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-06T23:01:18.461Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have found that quest is not worth the trouble of continuing to support in my world. When requesting to have it removed from my world (The Castle) I was told its not possible to do this right now. I was then told to simply put a blank world in its place or something to that effect. \nThe problem is, this is not a solution. If a quest user stayed in the world until they became the master it would effectively break all kinds of things for PC users.\nCan I just have it deleted please? Otherwise I will be forced to start my worlds stats over from scratch with a fresh ID.",
